er Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton NZM molded case circuit breakers (MCCB)</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Eaton NZM (Moeller series) MCCBs protecting distribution systems, motors and generators to IEC/EN 60947-2.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "NZM1 / NZM2 / NZM3 / NZM4"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-izmx-acb/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/qoenvvqx/izmx-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc1684342f9\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton IZMX air circuit breakers (ACB)</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Eaton IZMX air circuit breakers for main LV switchboards &#x2013; electronic protection, metering and communication built in.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "IZMX16 / IZMX40"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-xeffect-faz-mcb/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/wadaxecl/faz-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc168ea7ec4\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton xEffect FAZ miniature circuit breakers (MCB)</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Eaton xEffect FAZ MCBs for industrial panels and buildings &#x2013; multiple tripping characteristics, high breaking capacity and matching accessories.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "FAZ"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-power-xpert-ux-mv-switchgear/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/bpve4kft/pd-power-xpert-ux.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd614374134d9c\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton Power Xpert UX medium-voltage switchgear</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Air-insulated primary distribution switchgear up to 24 kV, certified to IEC 62271-100/-200, with vacuum circuit breakers and vacuum contactors.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "Power Xpert UX"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-xiria-ring-main-unit/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/dugfuv2j/pd-xiria-plus.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6143741ff998\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton Xiria medium-voltage ring main unit</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Ring main units for secondary distribution up to 24 kV, using vacuum switching and solid insulation &#x2013; SF6-free.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "Xiria / Xiria Plus"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-mv-vacuum-circuit-breakers/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/omrpmtul/pd-vcp-w.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6143742ded78\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton medium-voltage vacuum circuit breakers</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Eaton medium-voltage vacuum circuit breakers for switchgear and retrofits, stored-energy spring mechanism and Eaton-made vacuum interrupters.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "VCP-W / W-VACi"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-xenergy-main-lv-switchboard/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/nd5f0kxe/pd-xenergy-main.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6143745c96fe\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton xEnergy Main low-voltage switchboard</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">IEC 61439 low-voltage switchboard and motor-control system, fixed or withdrawable, up to 7,100 A, with Eaton IZMX ACBs and NZM MCCBs.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "xEnergy Main"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-edr-3000-edr-5000-relays/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/hadn2r3f/pd-edr-5000.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6143746bfa77\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton EDR 3000 / EDR 5000 protection relays</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Distribution relays combining protection, metering and control in one compact case for all voltage levels.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>"