5P) to online double-conversion (9SX, 9E) for PCs, network racks, servers and control systems.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "5E / 5P / 9SX / 9E"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/power-distribution/eaton-epdu-rack-pdu/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/bqqnxp2k/pd-managed-pdu.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd614376f6a9c3\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Eaton Power Distribution</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton ePDU rack power distribution units</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Rack PDUs &#x2013; Basic, Metered, Managed and Switched &#x2013; metering, monitoring and remote outlet control for data centres and server rooms.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "ePDU Basic / Metered / Managed / Switched"}], "size": 16}